WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
After the plan is submitted, it must be implemented

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:07,240
How about going to a reporting company in the summer? Yu Han

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,760
Flowers and beauty

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,280
There are only flowers like this

5
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,760
Only then can I express my feelings for you, Mr. Jiang

6
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,280
I've made it clear enough

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,680
Don't come to the company again to disturb my work, Yuhan

8
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,120
This is outrageous of you

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:23,760
This is my private office. No entry is allowed. I don't know how the front desk let you in.

10
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,360
I will notify people of the replacement until this step is checked.

11
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:27,800
I already know what to do next.

12
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,660
But we can't involve Tingting.

13
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,980
My big worker came here to spend time

14
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,700
It was airlifted from Yunnan this morning and I went to pick it up in person.

15
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,420
Just from this intention

16
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,940
You can't be so cold, right Mr. Jiang?

17
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,820
You will affect my work again

18
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,380
I'll ask the security guard to ask you out

19
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:50,810
I don't have time to spend time with you Hua Yuhan

20
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:53,090
You said you come from a girl's family

21
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,330
Why are you always so serious?

22
00:00:54,810 --> 00:00:56,090
Isn’t this company your father’s?

23
00:00:56,090 --> 00:00:57,410
Are you driving it to pass the time?

24
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,000
You need to be so serious

25
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:00,480
this is my career

26
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:02,040
You really make her your career?

27
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,020
If you tell me, people will die unfilially
